Package: asix-ax88179-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS source for the ASIX AX88179 USB Ethernet driver
 This package provides the source code for the ASIX AX88179B, AX88179A,
 AX88772D, AX88772E, and AX88279 kernel module and uses DKMS to build and
 install it for installed kernels.
